kind: profile
question: which kernels, by site (NVFP4 twin gemm32, routed and shared IQ2_XXS GEMM, attention flash, Mamba scan,
  router, norms), make G1's 4096-id Bolt prompt on the 3090?
term: kernel s of the prompt (nsys-table.py, --sort sum), generate_qwen3moe built at 19863679 (room-gated G1; the A6000 keeps the twins) --tokens <lcg 4096>
  -n 2 --ctx 4352 --time, RTX 3090 (the twins do not fit: NVFP4 sites as the 8-column gemv)
unit: s
predict: 7.5..8.6
condition: one lease (lease-hold.sh), BLOOMERY_CARD=3090, BLOOMERY_TIMING_GPU = the 3090, nsys -t cuda --cuda-graph-trace=node
